usage: reptor ai [-h] [--conf] --task TASK [--model MODEL]
                 [--temperature TEMP] [--skills-dir DIR]
                 [--skip-fields FIELDS] [--dry-run] [--duplicate]

Process report sections using OpenAI with dynamic skill selection

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --conf, --config      Configure plugin settings
  --task TASK           Task prompt for processing sections
  --model MODEL         OpenAI model to use (default: gpt-5.4-mini)
  --temperature TEMP    Sampling temperature 0-2 (default: 0.7)
  --skills-dir DIR      Directory containing skill .md files
  --skip-fields FIELDS  Fields to skip, comma-separated
  --dry-run             Preview processing without making API calls
  --duplicate           Duplicate the project before processing (applies changes to copy, not original)
